  "limitations": [
    "The handler fixture uses mocked descriptor lists, DMA, cfg80211 and firmware submission; it does not run a concurrent tasklet or radio.",
    "The removed-VAP branch no longer resets for a confirmed BSS descriptor, but it does not protect a VAP handle already resolved by another in-flight callback.",
    "AP netdev unregister still precedes target serializer stop; broader VAP/netdev lifetime and RTNL ownership require separate synchronization.",
    "Dynamic AP add/delete perform netdev register/unregister on a serializer kthread while the WEXT caller holds RTNL; the published VAP slot is also cleared only after core/DF cleanup.",
    "The stock checker, writer, LuCI route and uhttpd ran only in isolated QEMU with flash commands captured.",
    "Boot, Ethernet, Wi-Fi, flash writes, power-loss behavior and bank fallback remain unverified on the user router."
